stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CREATED
    CREATED --> VALIDATING
    VALIDATING --> ROUTING
    ROUTING --> PROCESSING
    PROCESSING --> COMMITTED: Bank + Central settled
    COMMITTED --> COMPLETED
    PROCESSING --> PENDING_RECONCILIATION: Timeout / unknown outcome
    PROCESSING --> BANK_SETTLED_CENTRAL_PENDING: Bank settled, central DB failed
    BANK_SETTLED_CENTRAL_PENDING --> COMPLETED: Central repair succeeded
    PENDING_RECONCILIATION --> COMPLETED: Bank confirmed settled
    PENDING_RECONCILIATION --> REVERSED: Definite failure + compensation
    PENDING_RECONCILIATION --> FAILED: Definite failure before hold
